      "description": "EVERYBODY WELCOME  \nFrom low-cost flexible memberships and 24 hour opening times, to quality gym equipment and classes included, there are loads of reasons why people love PureGym. Our mission is to help people everywhere to lead a healthy and happy life every day. \n\nUsing the PureGym App is the best way to get the most from your gym membership. Our great features ensure you’re able to manage your membership in the palm of your hand.\n\nFeatures include:\n\nCONTACTLESS ENTRY\nGain quick, contactless access to the gym by using the entry scanner on the app.\n\nLIVE ATTENDANCE TRACKER\nPlan your visit to the gym by checking how busy the gym is using our live attendance tracker.\n\nBOOK & MANAGE CLASSES\nYou can book any of the classes available at your gym from the app and if you change your mind, can cancel them in just a few taps. \n\nFREE WORKOUTS\nChoose from loads of great classes and workouts on demand to try in the gym or at home.\n\nTRACK ACTIVITY\nTrack your attendance and build good habits so you can monitor your progress and make achieving your fitness goals easier.\n\nMANAGE YOUR MEMBERSHIP\nManaging your membership in the PureGym app is easy. From changing your gym to updating your payment details – this can all be managed at your fingertips.\n\n\nEVERYBODY WELCOME\nWe welcome everyone regardless of gender, sexuality, size, age, ethnicity or ability. Our gyms are friendly, supportive and judgement free spaces where everybody can come in, work out and leave feeling good. Come and join us today and enjoy a range of benefits:\n\n* No contract memberships\n* Open 24 hours\n* Classes included in your membership\n* Huge range of quality kit\n* Experienced personal trainers\n\nYOUR FITNESS COMMUNITY\nDiscover what’s new in the health, fitness and wellbeing community, including free workouts and nutritional hints and tips.\n\nINSIDE THE GYM\nOur gyms are designed with you in mind, from the way the gym is laid out, to the range of equipment available.",
